            "notes": "TLDR: \n- [Compensator](item_2a354f80-610c-4661-9bdd-8960ae1a60b0)\n- [Weapon Grease](item_961ae72f-434f-406b-a89b-ab8efec806bf)\n- [Armored Vest](item_358361e2-59be-4c81-b221-8a87f37809e6)\n\n---\n\n[Tethered Tourniquet](item_9ac02f9a-7c06-46a3-94d4-2ba9a9cf623f) will help us easily get as much money from heals and assists as we need to have an easy round 2. [Compensator](item_2a354f80-610c-4661-9bdd-8960ae1a60b0) and [Weapon Grease](item_961ae72f-434f-406b-a89b-ab8efec806bf) are non-negotiable, but your survivability item is flexible between [Ballistic Buffer](item_40146dd3-a8cb-40ca-8917-c430bfa2be0e) and [Armored Vest](item_358361e2-59be-4c81-b221-8a87f37809e6).",
