            "notes": "**TLDR:**\n![Image](https://i.imgur.com/Fwz2ymV.gif \"small\")\n\n---\n\n### POWERS\n\nHere, I present you the gift of versatility. **Every match is different** so adjust your build to your current needs and wants. \n\n- [Renaissance](item_a460f234-6434-4d47-99f9-d4a0b15cd591) *more movement and team support*\n- [Serenity](item_c6e1c072-ff50-467e-b59f-9506baea10c1) *self-sustain and better healing output*\n- [First Responder](item_30a5c70f-e0b5-489a-96ae-900f34c3823d) *allows for safer resurrections*\n- [Supply Surge](item_35d75d9e-66b7-426a-b92d-9dfd72ee5fbb) *more versatility in how you support team*\n- [Tethered Tourniquet](item_9ac02f9a-7c06-46a3-94d4-2ba9a9cf623f) *pew-pew them during [Valkyrie](ability_8516272b-d022-49d3-b37e-45ce284c61d8)*\n\n---\n\n### ITEMS\n\nThe **core kit** is:\n\n- [Long Distance Wings](item_8b4bafad-c8bc-4c77-bbe7-798b03920c88)\n- [Blessed Boosters](item_957fd380-b7b4-40d4-8333-bb8c535ca931)\n- [Angelic Acrobatics](item_baad85fc-3da5-43af-ad9d-f17885f59aa5)\n- [Superflexor](item_580b77b4-0d63-469b-99a8-5372c55dfc1b)\n\nNow it depends on what you need from the rest of your kit, though most of it is either self-explanatory or I have already elaborated on it in a previous round, so I will only go over any new appearances.\n\n- [Chain Evoker](item_812cc89e-feb0-47d0-9e03-9d8e33a80aca) *works well with [Tethered Tourniquet](item_9ac02f9a-7c06-46a3-94d4-2ba9a9cf623f) since you get [Valkyrie](ability_8516272b-d022-49d3-b37e-45ce284c61d8) faster*\n- [Resurrection Rangefinder](item_99baffec-51b5-42e4-be61-e29f3de8219f) *works well with [Renaissance](item_a460f234-6434-4d47-99f9-d4a0b15cd591) and [First Responder](item_30a5c70f-e0b5-489a-96ae-900f34c3823d) since they both focus on [Resurrect](ability_8cd3a890-90fe-4161-a62e-d4bbf30e9584)*\n- [Ogundimu Reduction Field](item_b12daf48-069b-44c1-88fe-221cbcff664d) *offers damage reduction*\n- [Lum\u00e9riCo Fusion Drive](item_3da81000-333c-460a-a1a2-09441bfda9c8) *amazing with [Guardian Angel](ability_5132a6c2-1b20-4776-9273-73d49e2d145a) and gives 15% [Ability Power](stat_ability_power)*\n- [Catalytic Crystal](item_3e3f4f77-cdf8-4dda-a5b0-2fb9390aefc4) *utilizes [The Whambulance](item_67e91029-d0fc-4c9d-9733-ec7e1cc064a9)'s [Ability Power](stat_ability_power) healing*\n- [Eye of the Spider](item_bbaf01d7-340d-4199-b738-86a98d68fe9b) *big boost to [Weapon Power](stat_weapon_power), plus finishing off low health enemies*",
